OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry
OL,6,Fevening and night with some long clear
OL,7,Fperiods. Frost will develop and will
OL,8,Fbecome moderate to severe in sheltered
OL,9,Fspots in the west.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FAnother dry and bright day
OL,12,Fwith some long sunny spells. Rather
OL,13,Fcold with frost early and late.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FRain
OL,16,Fspreading east on Tuesday with snow on
OL,17,Fhigher ground for a time. Rain
OL,18,Flingering into Wednesday, dying out
OL,19,Flater then mainly dry on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
